{"4291370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greenfield Valley", "steam_appid": 4291370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow for updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d84202a88bf300ded8c076dea2302a6a.avif?t=1775747947\" width=750 height=250 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/5738f7fa2d1846f012e72a9a82cf1a98.avif?t=1775747947\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras_big/5738f7fa2d1846f012e72a9a82cf1a98.webp?t=1775747947 width=1560 height=485 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/626963c0409d020bf08ddf6f861c3e47.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/626963c0409d020bf08ddf6f861c3e47.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/626963c0409d020bf08ddf6f861c3e47.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🌾 <strong>Your Dream Farm in the Mountains</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit a quiet farm hidden deep in a peaceful mountain valley and begin a slower, more mindful life. Surrounded by gentle peaks, wooden houses, and open fields, you can settle into a calm daily routine focused on farming, exploration, and steady progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6411d0a3bb2f854b1e4ef0031f7075fa.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6411d0a3bb2f854b1e4ef0031f7075fa.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6411d0a3bb2f854b1e4ef0031f7075fa.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>Everyday Farm Life and Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm is home to several animals, including cows, sheep, chickens, horses, and a loyal dog. Animals need food and water to grow and stay productive. Adult cows, sheep, and chickens provide valuable products, while horses can be raised and sold for profit once they mature.<br>The dog is a decorative companion, but earning its trust requires patience and regular feeding.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/70b41388c18265abbff7d4bc82526808.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/70b41388c18265abbff7d4bc82526808.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/70b41388c18265abbff7d4bc82526808.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥕 <strong>Growing and Harvesting Crops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant a variety of vegetables using seeds from the local shop. Each crop requires watering and goes through its own growth stages before it is ready to harvest. Vegetables have different values, and harvest results are not fixed. Each collection randomly rewards items based on defined chances, making every harvest slightly different.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6635f4a9852f85a22a21434a4096466a.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6635f4a9852f85a22a21434a4096466a.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6635f4a9852f85a22a21434a4096466a.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎣 <strong>Fishing and Skill-Based Mini Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing offers a relaxing but engaging activity. Use different types of fishing rods, where better rods allow you to catch rarer and more valuable fish. There are dozens of fish species with varying difficulty levels.<br>Each catch involves a short mini game where you must keep the fish within a safe zone until the progress bar fills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/fabdfb3cb3411e674dc3ecf5d0601b91.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/fabdfb3cb3411e674dc3ecf5d0601b91.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/fabdfb3cb3411e674dc3ecf5d0601b91.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛏ <strong>Resources and Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources like wood and stone using tools such as an axe or pickaxe. These materials are essential for upgrading your house, tools, and farmland. Higher upgrade levels unlock new features and improve efficiency. Upgrades require not only money, but also the right character level and materials, all clearly explained in the upgrade shop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/3a80c839bc71715b074231c35506e327.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/3a80c839bc71715b074231c35506e327.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/3a80c839bc71715b074231c35506e327.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 <strong>House Progression and Cooking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small house that can be expanded step by step. As your home improves, new rooms and systems become available. Once your house reaches the required level, you can begin cooking meals using gathered products. Cooked meals can be sold for higher prices and restore more stamina than raw food.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/787f8e0d72632331624c4ee01653ee16.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/787f8e0d72632331624c4ee01653ee16.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/787f8e0d72632331624c4ee01653ee16.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Stamina and Daily Rhythm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action uses stamina. When it runs out, you can no longer farm, water crops, care for animals, fish, gather resources, or harvest vegetables.<br>Stamina can be restored by eating vegetables or by sleeping and starting a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/13cc4696f32dd317bb9a355da731ee2d.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/13cc4696f32dd317bb9a355da731ee2d.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/13cc4696f32dd317bb9a355da731ee2d.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦 <strong>Living World and Weather System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world features a dynamic weather system that changes daily. Rain waters your crops automatically, while fog reduces visibility. You can always check the forecast on the TV inside your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d77c32813043e4d0326d51c2b7725299.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d77c32813043e4d0326d51c2b7725299.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d77c32813043e4d0326d51c2b7725299.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Quests and Long-Term Goals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both unique and repeatable quests. Completing them increases your level, grants useful items, and sometimes unlocks new mechanics such as fishing. Quests provide direction without pressure and encourage long-term planning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/0f4ac0968136f93ca5e31dda19a24149.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/0f4ac0968136f93ca5e31dda19a24149.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/0f4ac0968136f93ca5e31dda19a24149.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>👨‍🌾 <strong>Working for a Local Farmer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the town, you can take on jobs for a local farmer from your very first day. Tasks are available during specific hours, making it easy to fit them into your daily routine.<br>No tools are required – everything you need is provided on-site.<br>In return, you’ll earn good money and experience points, making it a great way to grow in the early stages of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/cb9e397bbbc8aa60367ec9a42737de24.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/cb9e397bbbc8aa60367ec9a42737de24.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/cb9e397bbbc8aa60367ec9a42737de24.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>✨ <strong>A Calm Low-Poly Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cozy low-poly world filled with soft colors and a relaxing atmosphere. Wooden houses, glass greenhouses, open farmland, and mountain landscapes are designed to help you slow down and enjoy a peaceful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers.<br>No pressure.<br>Just you, your farm, and a quiet moment in the mountains.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/5738f7fa2d1846f012e72a9a82cf1a98.avif?t=1775747947\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras_big/5738f7fa2d1846f012e72a9a82cf1a98.webp?t=1775747947 width=1560 height=485 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/626963c0409d020bf08ddf6f861c3e47.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/626963c0409d020bf08ddf6f861c3e47.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/626963c0409d020bf08ddf6f861c3e47.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🌾 <strong>Your Dream Farm in the Mountains</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherit a quiet farm hidden deep in a peaceful mountain valley and begin a slower, more mindful life. Surrounded by gentle peaks, wooden houses, and open fields, you can settle into a calm daily routine focused on farming, exploration, and steady progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/6411d0a3