and improve efficiency. Upgrades require not only money, but also the right character level and materials, all clearly explained in the upgrade shop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/3a80c839bc71715b074231c35506e327.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/3a80c839bc71715b074231c35506e327.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/3a80c839bc71715b074231c35506e327.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 <strong>House Progression and Cooking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small house that can be expanded step by step. As your home improves, new rooms and systems become available. Once your house reaches the required level, you can begin cooking meals using gathered products. Cooked meals can be sold for higher prices and restore more stamina than raw food.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/787f8e0d72632331624c4ee01653ee16.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/787f8e0d72632331624c4ee01653ee16.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/787f8e0d72632331624c4ee01653ee16.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Stamina and Daily Rhythm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action uses stamina. When it runs out, you can no longer farm, water crops, care for animals, fish, gather resources, or harvest vegetables.<br>Stamina can be restored by eating vegetables or by sleeping and starting a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/13cc4696f32dd317bb9a355da731ee2d.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/13cc4696f32dd317bb9a355da731ee2d.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/13cc4696f32dd317bb9a355da731ee2d.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦 <strong>Living World and Weather System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world features a dynamic weather system that changes daily. Rain waters your crops automatically, while fog reduces visibility. You can always check the forecast on the TV inside your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d77c32813043e4d0326d51c2b7725299.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d77c32813043e4d0326d51c2b7725299.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/d77c32813043e4d0326d51c2b7725299.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Quests and Long-Term Goals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both unique and repeatable quests. Completing them increases your level, grants useful items, and sometimes unlocks new mechanics such as fishing. Quests provide direction without pressure and encourage long-term planning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/0f4ac0968136f93ca5e31dda19a24149.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/0f4ac0968136f93ca5e31dda19a24149.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/0f4ac0968136f93ca5e31dda19a24149.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>👨‍🌾 <strong>Working for a Local Farmer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the town, you can take on jobs for a local farmer from your very first day. Tasks are available during specific hours, making it easy to fit them into your daily routine.<br>No tools are required – everything you need is provided on-site.<br>In return, you’ll earn good money and experience points, making it a great way to grow in the early stages of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/cb9e397bbbc8aa60367ec9a42737de24.poster.avif?t=1775747947\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/cb9e397bbbc8aa60367ec9a42737de24.webm?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/extras/cb9e397bbbc8aa60367ec9a42737de24.mp4?t=1775747947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>✨ <strong>A Calm Low-Poly Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cozy low-poly world filled with soft colors and a relaxing atmosphere. Wooden houses, glass greenhouses, open farmland, and mountain landscapes are designed to help you slow down and enjoy a peaceful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers.<br>No pressure.<br>Just you, your farm, and a quiet moment in the mountains.</p>", "short_description": "Build your peaceful farm in a quiet mountain valley. Grow crops, care for animals, complete quests, level up, and upgrade your home. A cozy farming experience with dynamic weather, no timers, and no pressure. Just relax and enjoy farm life.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Swedish, Turkish, Hungarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/73e23eb2a3fea8c8b14f6ecd82e3ef083d1c1876/header.jpg?t=1775747947", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/56d229bfc4cde29919c9eb691b5d8a0d8bea3b66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775747947", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291370/56d229bfc4cde29919c9eb691b5d8a0d8bea3b66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775747947", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> +2.5 GHZ dual core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Soundcard</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS: